{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>If I sharpen.</b> Doubled conjugation, like וחנותי לבני בטני (and I graced the children of my womb), from the root of חץ שנון (sharp arrow)." "<b>And my hand grasps judgment.</b> The sword — the judgment of a warrior of war." "<b>I shall repay vengeance.</b> The sense of אשיב: as they did to Israel. And likewise אשלם."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:26:13.473979012Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}